# The decal occlusion tests on the graph (CS_ORG_OCCLUSION_QUERIES=1, docs/development/p5/occlusion-queries.md, "The decal
# occlusion test"), with sun-query-org1.env's switches (the flush latch and the census on). Riverwood at 13:00, third person, one
# melee bandit (1bcd8) placed at the player, whose health is raised: the hits leave blood decals, which the engine tests before it
# places them. After the fight the AI is turned off (tai) and the camera looks down at the ground. Against decal-query-org0.env:
# blood decals in both (their placement is the engine's random draws: compare that there are some, not where); '[DCLF] decal
# occlusion: the first cs.decals.occlusion run drawn by the graph'; the census has no draw 'through AE 36562'.
# cs-ab: disable-mod=Skyrim Engine Telemetry
CS_ORG_ENGINE_FLUSH_LATCH=1
CS_ORG_RESIDUE_CENSUS=1
CS_ORG_RESIDUE_CENSUS_FRAMES=300
CS_ORG_RESIDUE_CENSUS_TOP=60
CS_ORG_SHADOW_MASK=1
CS_ORG_COMPOSITE=1
CS_ORG_IBL=1
CS_ORG_SCREEN_SPACE_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_TERRAIN_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_VOLUMETRIC_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_SKYLIGHTING=1
CS_ORG_GRASS_COLLISION=1
CS_ORG_LIGHT_LIMIT_FIX_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_SCREEN_SPACE_GI=1
CS_ORG_SUBSURFACE_SCATTERING=1
CS_ORG_EXPONENTIAL_HEIGHT_FOG=1
CS_ORG_DYNAMIC_CUBEMAPS=1
CS_ORG_CLOUD_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_POST_PROCESSING=1
CS_ORG_HDR_DISPLAY=1
CS_ORG_UPSCALING=1
CS_ORG_SCREENSHOT=1
CS_ORG_TERRAIN_BLENDING=1
CS_ORG_GLINTS=1
CS_ORG_E11_RAYS=1
CS_ORG_IMGUI=1
CS_ORG_TRIPWIRE_GUEST=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_TARGETS=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_TARGET_HANDLES=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_BUFFERS=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_TEXTURES=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_SHADERS=1
CS_ORG_TEXTURE_STREAMING=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_CONSTANTS=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_SKELETON=1
CS_ORG_SKY=1
CS_ORG_SKY_CLOUDS=0
CS_ORG_WATER=1
CS_ORG_BLOOD_SPLATTER=1
CS_ORG_IMAGESPACE=1
CS_ORG_MENU3D=1
CS_ORG_MAP=1
CS_ORG_SCALEFORM=1
CS_ORG_BINK=1
CS_ORG_LOADING_THREAD=1
CS_ORG_TRIPWIRE_WATCH_ALL=1
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_ORG_OCCLUSION_QUERIES=1
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=600:set timescale to 0;601:set gamehour to 13;602:fw 81a;700:coc Riverwood;1800:set timescale to 0;1810:dclf:pov=third;1820:player.setav health 100000;1830:player.placeatme 1bcd8 1;2400:tai;2410:player.setangle x 70;2411:player.setangle z 0;2600:dclf:shot=decals1;2700:dclf:shot=decals2
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=2800
